%% HAND-CURATED. Profile-field sanitization (AMD-012) covers prompt-injection blocklist on nickname + favoriteTopics — reject pre-write.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ParentApp
    participant Gateway
    participant IdentityService

    ParentApp->>Gateway: POST /v1/households/:householdId/children {nickname, ageBand, favoriteTopics, ...} + Bearer JWT + X-Request-Id
    Gateway->>Gateway: rate-limit (sys-17) — parent_write — 30 per minute per parent ID
    Gateway->>IdentityService: forward request
    alt parent_write_rate_limited
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 429 parent_write_rate_limited
    else insufficient_household_role
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 403 insufficient_household_role
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 403
    else prompt_injection_rejected
        Note over IdentityService: AMD-012 — nickname or favoriteTopics matched injection blocklist
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 400
    else validation_error
        Note over IdentityService: nickname length/regex, ageBand enum, dob future or >18y, favoriteTopics size
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 422 invalid_age_band | 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 4xx
    else child_profile_limit_exceeded
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 409 child_profile_limit_exceeded
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 409
    else success
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 201 {childProfile: {id, householdId, nickname, ageBand, status: "active", ...}}
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 201
    end

    Note over ParentApp,IdentityService: timeout 5s p99 — idempotent via X-Request-Id — never retry on 4xx (deterministic validation outcome)
